      "guarded": false,
      "in": "K0156",
      "key": "K0157",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 19: from about 21:00 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:08 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:14 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 10:15 I was at the grocery; around 10:08 I passed through the square; from about 10:15 to 11:15 I was at the clinic; around 11:15 I passed through the square; around 11:21 I passed through Mill Road; from about 11:30 to 11:45 I was at the Okafor house.",
      "time": 27179,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "arvid",
       "ida"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0158",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Arvid told me there's bad blood between them and Ida \u2014 an unpaid bill from last winter.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
