      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 19: from about 21:00 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:20 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:26 I passed through the square; from about 08:30 to 10:15 I was at the grocery; around 10:17 I passed through the square; from about 10:15 to 11:45 I was at the workshop.",
