      "key": "K0276",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 19: from about 21:00 to 07:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 07:17 I passed through the square; around 07:23 I passed through Mill Road; from about 07:30 to 11:45 I was at the mill.",
      "time": 27179,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
