      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 19: from about 21:00 to 22:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 22:08 I passed through the square; around 22:14 I passed through Mill Road; from about 22:15 to 09:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 09:12 I passed through Mill Road; around 09:18 I passed through the square; from about 09:15 to 11:45 I was at the clinic; after that it gets hazy \u2014 I'd had a fair bit to drink.",
      "time": 27179,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
     {
      "about": [
       "arvid",
       "ida"
      ],
      "facts": [],
      "guarded": false,
      "key": "K0390",
      "place": null,
      "source": "told",
      "text": "Arvid told me there's bad blood between them and Ida \u2014 an unpaid bill from last winter.",
      "time": null,
      "topics": [
