      "key": "K0483",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 19: from about 21:00 to 00:15 I was at the Drover's Rest; around 00:17 I passed through the square; from about 00:15 to 11:45 I was at home, asleep for most of it.",
      "time": 27179,
      "topics": [
