       "K0523",
       "K0526"
      ],
      "place": "pub",
      "source": "saw",
      "text": "At the Drover's Rest, from about 18:00 to 23:00 on Day 19, I saw Arvid, Ida and Jonas, coming and going.",
      "time": 26999,
